CarZone - Full Stack Car Rental Management System

A comprehensive Full Stack Web Application designed to streamline car rental bookings and user inquiries. This project showcases a modern, responsive frontend integrated with a robust Java-based backend.

---
Key Features

* Dynamic Car Catalog: Browse through a variety of car brands and models with a clean UI.
* Interactive Booking Engine: A smart booking form that dynamically updates car models based on the selected brand.
* Client-Side Validation:Date Logic: Past dates are automatically disabled for pickups using JavaScript.
    * Data Integrity:Phone number inputs are restricted to exactly 10 digits to prevent user error.
* Modern User Feedback:Replaced traditional browser alerts with custom **Toast Notifications** for a premium user experience.
* RESTful API Architecture: A Java Spring Boot backend handles all data processing and communicates with the database via REST endpoints.
* Responsive UI:** Optimized for a seamless experience across Mobile, Tablet, and Desktop devices.

---
Tech Stack

Frontend:
* HTML5 & CSS3: For structured layouts and custom styling/animations.
* JavaScript: For DOM manipulation, dynamic form logic, and Fetch API integration.

Backend:
* Java: Core programming language.
* Spring Boot:Framework for building the REST API and managing dependencies.
* Spring Data JPA / Hibernate: For Object-Relational Mapping (ORM) and database management.

Database:
* MySQL:Used for persistent data storage of user bookings and contacts.

---
Project Directory Structure

```text
├── src/main/java           # Java Backend (Controllers, Entities, Repositories)
├── src/main/resources      # Application configurations & MySQL settings
├── images                  # Project assets (Car gallery & UI images)
├── index.html              # Main Landing Page
├── car.html                # Car Listing & Fleet Page
├── css/                    # Custom CSS files
└── js/                     # Client-side JavaScript & API logic
